From 5b50f4f678a83198d535917a04823a5ccfe18285 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 10:31:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nerdnos: add virtual asic submit path

Why: move the NerdNos source from API-only boot to deterministic guest-side submit replay by adding a virtual BM1370 ASIC implementation that feeds the native sendWork/processWork/test_nonce_value boundary.

Virtual-only: selected by BOARD=VIRTUALAXE_GAMMA; physical NerdNos boards keep their existing ASIC classes and startup path.

Upstream surface: BM1397 ASIC interface virtual dispatch, virtual ASIC worker, stale-job generation IDs, fractional Stratum V1 difficulty parsing, virtual board ASIC initialization, and the virtual startup task list.

Verify: SOURCE=nerdnos make patch-check, python3 scripts/virtualaxe.py build --source nerdnos --profile gamma --json, and make verify-submit-replay SOURCE=nerdnos.

Removal impact: NerdNos remains API-boot-only and cannot prove the upstream submit boundary with deterministic replay.
